WEBVTT

00:00:00.122 --> 00:00:05.802
Creating lesson plans

00:00:05.852 --> 00:00:09.655
Open Planning and Delivery, then Lesson Plans.

00:00:13.799 --> 00:00:20.927
Press Add Lesson Plan, then Create single lesson plan. Choose Standard for the full details.

00:00:25.993 --> 00:00:30.727
Enter the title, choose the class, the subject and the teacher.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:53.864
Press Select chapter or topic, tick a topic from the book, and press Apply.

00:01:02.685 --> 00:01:05.634
Set the lesson date and write an objective.

00:01:19.615 --> 00:01:27.109
Leave the status as Draft and press Create Lesson Plan. To see it, choose the class and the lesson date.

00:01:39.904 --> 00:01:42.648
Press Publish on the plan to share it.

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:50.515
Lesson plan published
